<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.6340 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.6340 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.6340 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6470 on Mar 24.</p>
<p>				   Mar 25	Mar 24</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.6340	4.6470</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   799,000     600,000</p>
